on NollStallAutoTimer
  [  0] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  3] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  5] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [  8] pushint8 60 ............................. <60>
  [ 11] mul ..................................... <35 * 60>
  [ 12] add ..................................... <the timer + (35 * 60)>
  [ 13] setglobal 40 ............................ AutoTimer = the timer + (35 * 60)
  [ 16] ret
end
